{"obsah":"<p><strong>UPDATE: Katarína reached her goal, although a bit differently than she wanted. Look forward to it – the book is happening.</strong></p>\n\n<p>Katarína has launched a HITHIT campaign to support the publication of her book.</p>\n\n<p>In brief, what it's all about:</p>\n\n<ul><li>New Bikeinstruktor book on mountain bike riding technique</li><li>The new Bikeinstruktor book will teach you to ride more technically</li><li>Bikeinstruktor – a book for beginner bikers – is coming out</li><li>Improve your bike skills with the new Bikeinstruktor book</li></ul>\n\n<p>The book Bikeinstruktor presents technique <strong>step by step</strong> in a simple, clear way – useful if you want more from your bike than just eating up kilometres. It's a manual for everyone, regardless of age or experience.&nbsp;</p>\n\n<p>The book is complemented by a large number of <strong>detailed illustrations</strong>, often broken down into individual sequences. Thanks to its 17 cm x 17 cm format it fits into a backpack or a handbag.&nbsp;</p>\n\n<p>In it you'll find the basic <strong>skills</strong>, from balance and riding through corners to jumping. There's also a chapter on building obstacles, first aid, basic bike care and a list of places to ride in the Czech Republic. And there are quite a few of them!</p>\n\n<p>The book was written by <strong>Katarína Tóthová</strong> based on her experience from racing and coaching. In her biking career she became a <strong>two-time national champion</strong> in downhill, overall winner of the Czech Downhill Cup, runner-up in four-cross and third in BMX racing. She is a former member of the national team and has extensive experience in dirt, dual, pump track and enduro.</p>\n\n<p>At the moment you can get the book <strong>in advance at a discounted price</strong> through the crowdfunding campaign on Hithit. There you choose your reward (e.g. a signed book delivered to your home) and the amount of your contribution. You'll receive your reward after the 30-day campaign ends.</p>\n\n<p>Support the project to publish the book. You'll learn to ride more technically and more safely.</p>\n\n<p>CAMPAIGN: <a href=\"https://www.hithit.com/cs/project/9775/bike-instruktor-prirucka-pro-zacinajici-bikery-a-bikerky\">https://www.hithit.com/cs/project/9775/bike-instruktor-prirucka-pro-zacinajici-bikery-a-bikerky</a></p>\n\n<p>WEBSITE: <a href=\"https://www.bikeinstruktor.cz/\">https://www.bikeinstruktor.cz/</a></p>\n\n<p>FACEBOOK: <a href=\"https://www.facebook.com/Bike-instruktor-106140254649828\">https://www.facebook.com/Bike-instruktor-106140254649828</a></p>\n\n<p>INSTAGRAM: <a href=\"https://www.instagram.com/bikeinstruktor/\">https://www.instagram.com/bikeinstruktor/</a></p>\n\n<p>YOUTUBE: <a href=\"https://www.youtube.com/channel/UCZJBKmMIeAUgoTRt3BMYH1A\">https://www.youtube.com/channel/UCZJBKmMIeAUgoTRt3BMYH1A</a></p>\n\n<figure class=\"wp-block-gallery columns-3 is-cropped\"><ul class=\"blocks-gallery-grid\"><li class=\"blocks-gallery-item\"><figure><a href=\"https://firebasestorage.googleapis.com/v0/b/bikeskills-web.firebasestorage.app/o/wp-content%2Fuploads%2F2021%2F04%2F12841.webp?alt=media\"><img src=\"https://firebasestorage.googleapis.com/v0/b/bikeskills-web.firebasestorage.app/o/wp-content%2Fuploads%2F2021%2F04%2F12841.webp?alt=media\" alt=\"\" data-id=\"190308\" data-full-url=\"https://firebasestorage.googleapis.com/v0/b/bikeskills-web.firebasestorage.app/o/wp-content%2Fuploads%2F2021%2F04%2F12841.webp?alt=media\" data-link=\"https://bikeskills.cz/?attachment_id=190308\" class=\"wp-image-190308\"/></a></figure></li><li class=\"blocks-gallery-item\"><figure><a href=\"https://firebasestorage.googleapis.com/v0/b/bikeskills-web.firebasestorage.app/o/wp-content%2Fuploads%2F2021%2F04%2F173099685_459799748629764_939078298951852788_n.webp?alt=media\"><img src=\"https://firebasestorage.googleapis.com/v0/b/bikeskills-web.firebasestorage.app/o/wp-content%2Fuploads%2F2021%2F04%2F173099685_459799748629764_93907